  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to education for children in conflict-affected areas in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure that children and young people access school through formal classes or flexible educational models in rural areas highly affected by the armed conflict and where barriers to education persist. The project aims to give continuity and closure to the actions that NRC develops in response to the situations generated by the armed conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
